==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[File:Azure Heraldic Shield.svg|right|thumb|The arms of Berington of Chester are <!--per Harleian manuscript no. 1535--> simply ''azure''.]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|asure}}, from {{der|en|fro|azur}}, derived from {{der|en|ar|لَازَوَرْد|t=lapis lazuli}}, dropping the '''''l''''' as if it were equivalent to the French article {{m|fr|l'}}. The Arabic is from {{der|en|fa-cls|لاجورد|tr=lājward|t=lapis lazuli}}, from the region of Lajward in [[Badakhshan]].

Compare with {{cog|it|azzurro}} and {{cog|es|azul}}.

